# Docs Lifecycle

Docs are part of the deliverable when behavior, architecture, workflow, or
operator expectations change.

Trust hierarchy:

1. foundation
2. product
3. system
4. implementation
5. module specs
6. proposals
7. repo-local notes

If code and docs disagree, update the stale doc in the same change when the
task touches that behavior. Proposals are context until active or promoted.
Archived and superseded docs are historical only.
